note cmdserve for the targets without serve.om (gb10, x86linux, x86efi): serve.om needs the om2
note profile and omega-mv e5b32567's seed/net/http.om, which build.sh composes on aarch64 only, so
note `ollm serve` refuses here with exit 2.
fn cmdserve to void
exit 2
end

note chatenc needs serve.om's CHAT1 encoder (aarch64 only): exit 2 here
fn cmdchatenc to void
exit 2
end
